  "instructions": [
    "Preheat grill to medium-high heat.",
    "In a large bowl, whisk together beer, paprika, garlic, salt, and pepper.",
    "Add beef cubes to the marinade and toss to coat.",
    "Cover bowl with plastic wrap and refrigerate for at least 2 hours or overnight.",
    "Thread beef and mushrooms onto skewers, leaving a small space between each piece.",
    "Brush grill with olive oil to prevent sticking.",
    "Grill skewers for 8-10 minutes per side, or until meat reaches an internal temperature of 63°C for medium-rare.",
    "Serve with warm Slovakian dark bread."
